---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Financial Fraud & Cheating Cases in Chennai" description="Defence in cheating, criminal breach of trust, and white-collar offences.">
  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <p class="text-gold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Practice Area</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-navy mb-6">Financial Fraud & Cheating</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg text-ink/90 space-y-5 leading-relaxed">
      <p>Allegations of cheating (Section 318 BNS), criminal breach of trust, forgery, and related economic offences require careful distinction between civil disputes and criminal liability. Many such cases arise from commercial transactions or property dealings.</p>
      <p>We examine the ingredients of the offence, the timing of the complaint, and available documentary evidence. Where appropriate, we consider quashing petitions under Section 528 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita.</p>
      <p>Representation is provided at the investigation stage, before charge, and throughout trial.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10">
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-navy text-cream px-8 py-3 rounded-sm hover:bg-navy/90 transition">Consult on Your Case</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
